  "description": "The best rides don't end because of a battery. With exceptional long-range performance, the AQ177 Pro Max takes you deeper into the outdoors, farther from the pavement, and back home with confidence—so every mile is spent exploring, not worrying about your remaining range.\n\nYou didn't get into delivery to babysit a battery. The AQ177 Pro Max gives you a full shift of real range, a comfortable, shock-absorbing seat for a smoother ride, and a cargo rack built for stacked orders—so every hour you're out is an hour you're earning, not waiting.\n\nEV-grade cells and a smart BMS deliver 150–200 mi (240–320 km) on a single charge — swap less, ride more, and take home more on every shift.\n\nOne Charge, Every Peak Rush. From the breakfast rush to the last late-night order, one battery carries you from sunrise to closing — no more watching the battery icon.\n\nMulti-Layer Protection. Zero Fire Risk. Battery fires are every rider's worst fear. We built safety to a standard you can actually trust.\n\nConquer every route with smooth direct-drive performance.\n\nPeak 750W / 1200W burst gives you instant torque for steep ramps and fast acceleration, even with a full delivery cargo. Never be the slow rider again.\n\nOur Direct Drive hub has NO internal gears, no friction, and no wear parts. Get maximum uptime with reduced maintenance costs and an incredibly smooth, silent ride.\n\nOn and off in seconds. Comfortable for hours.\n\nA low step-through frame lets you get on and off in seconds — no swinging a leg over a loaded bike between stops. Built for riders who dismount dozens of times a shift, in any outfit, gear, or weather.\n\nA suspension seatpost absorbs the shock of potholes, curbs, and rough pavement before it reaches your back. Ride longer, feel less beat up, and finish your shift with energy left over — not sore from the road.",
